# SynAPS workspace

Python scheduling kernel (`synaps/`). Not MicroPhoenix.
Never open `C:\plans`. Ignore its AGENTS.md / CLAUDE.md / `.cursor/rules`.

Live roots: `C:\SynAPS`, `C:\SynAPS-GridPlan`, `C:\SynAPS-MobiRoute`, `C:\AeroBIM`.
Energy ТОиР is GridPlan. DARP is MobiRoute. AeroBIM is a separate IFC product.
